      "title": {
        "en": "O mnie, o tobie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "After *o* (about), *ja* becomes *mnie*: *mówi o mnie* (she talks about me). The others: *o tobie*, *o nim* (him, or a masculine thing), *o niej*, *o nas*, *o was*, *o nich*. *Nie chcę o nich mówić* is I don't want to talk about them."
      },
